  "Click Terms.",
  "Use the arrows to move the following terms to Selected Terms: Emmenthaler, Gruyere, Broth, AB, BC, A*X1, B*X1, C*X1.",
  "Click OK and then click Graphs.",
  "Under Residual Plots, select Four in one.",
  "Click OK in each dialog box."
